# Netlify redirects.
#
# Kept for the current Netlify deployment. The Cloudflare Pages equivalent is
# `config/deploy/_redirects.cloudflare` — the two hosts cannot read one file,
# because Cloudflare Pages cannot proxy to an external origin at all, and a
# stale hard-coded API host in the client bundle is a class of bug worth
# making visible rather than hiding.

# API proxy
/api/* https://runrealm.coupondj.fun/api/:splat 200

# SPA fallback - serve index.html for all other routes
/* /index.html 200
